      "value": "Can you provide logs? Specifically from Files app. Go to \"On my iPhone/iPad\", then find the \"VRChat\" folder. The logs will be in that folder.\n\nFeel free to add them to a support ticket and link this post in it.  https://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/requests/new",
